---
source: crates/inkgen-testing/src/lib.rs
expression: code
---
A FHIR code generator that transforms canonical FHIR packages into SDKs

Usage: inkgen <COMMAND>

Commands:
  fetch     Fetch FHIR packages from canonical sources
  generate  Generate code from FHIR packages
  config    Configure inkgen settings
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
